me options, and not on modding. Therefore, I'm returning to the initial plan to document the in-game settings within the `README.md` file. I'll utilize the Python installer solely for the Theme XML as this avoids unnecessary complexity. This decision is validated as the most streamlined approach.\n\n\n"}
